    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d7-a5">

                <pb facs="0041" n="695" xml:id="pg695"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[E.—Inclosure 5 in No.
                    364.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Excellent to Mr.
                            Bassett.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bureau of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Port au
                                Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1875-05-04"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 4,
                        1875</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Minister</hi>: The government being informed that
                    the persons named Nathan Modé, Alonzo Iacinthe, and Jean Alerte have taken
                    refuge at your house, prays you to be pleased to deliver them up, (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">vousprie de vouloir Men les lui livrer</hi>,) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">sought out as they are by the government, according to
                        the law.</hi></p>
                <p>The government does not doubt that you will appreciate the present measure,
                    dictated as it is by a sense of the most precious interests of the country.</p>
                <p>Be pleased to accept, Mr. Minister, the new assurances of my very high
                    consideration.</p>
                <closer><signed>EXCELLENT,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State for
                            Foreign Affairs.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ebenezer D. Bassett</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Minister-Resident of the United States, Port au
                            Prince.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
